@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

title VirtualMotionTracker Architecture

package "VirtualMotionTracker" {
  component "VMT Manager" as Manager
  component "VMT Driver" as Driver
  component "Shared Memory\n(JSON channels)" as ShMem
  artifact "Legacy Controller Binding\nmycontroller.json" as Binding
}

rectangle "User Application" as UserApp <<External>>
rectangle "SteamVR / OpenVR Runtime" as OpenVR <<External>>

UserApp ..> Manager : OSC control input

Manager --> ShMem : JSON\nmanager_to_driver
ShMem --> Driver : JSON\nmanager_to_driver

Driver --> ShMem : JSON\ndriver_to_manager
ShMem --> Manager : JSON\ndriver_to_manager

Driver --> OpenVR : OpenVR driver interface

Binding ..> OpenVR : consumed by runtime
Binding ..> Driver : packaged with driver

note right of ShMem
Bidirectional channels with control fields:
- send_count
- handshake_count
- message_length
end note

note bottom of Binding
- controller_type: "mycontroller"
- right-hand mappings:
  /user/hand/right/input/a -> /actions/legacy/in/right_axis1_press
  /user/hand/right/input/c -> /actions/legacy/in/right_a_press
  /user/hand/right/input/b -> /actions/legacy/in/right_grip_press
- mode: "button", parameters.sub_mode: "complex"
end note

@enduml
